 "brief": "Raded, a force belonging to resistance security services in Gaza, disclosed details of an ambush it carried out on October 8 against militias cooperating with Israeli occupation forces, Shehab Wire reported. The operation targeted the collaborationist groups in an area near Bir Abu Hafez in Mawasi Rafah, in southern Gaza.\n\nThe force provided specifics of the ambush but Shehab Wire's report did not detail casualties or other operational results from the engagement.",
